  "DYNAMIC LATEST DATA": "动态最新数据",
  "Native transforms precede alignment. Closed calendar periods only; weekly ends Sunday. Period end retains a missing final source record; average uses non-null records and reports missing counts; last available skips nulls within the same bucket only. No upsampling, cross-period fill or interpolation.": "先按原生频率转换，再对齐已结束的日历区间；周度以周日结束。期末值保留末条记录的缺失；平均值使用非缺失记录并报告缺失数量；最后可用值仅在同一区间内跳过空值。不升频、不跨期填补、不插值。",
  "USREC / FRED monthly recession indicator; latest chronology, not an announcement-time signal": "USREC / FRED 月度衰退指标；使用事后时间表，并非当时发布的信号",
  "Native transforms first; weekly-to-month/quarter assigns each published weekly observation to its observation-date bucket, no prorating or forward fill": "先做原生频率转换；周度转月度或季度时按观测日期归入相应区间，不按天拆分，也不向前填补。",
  "Correlation is not causation or verified prediction.": "相关性不代表因果，也不是已验证的预测。",
  "Raw levels can be nonstationary; use defensible growth/change transforms.": "原始水平值可能非平稳，应选择有依据的增长率或变化转换。",
  "Autocorrelation reduces independent information; no iid p-values are reported.": "自相关会降低独立信息量；此处不报告基于独立同分布假设的 p 值。",
  "Best lag maximizes absolute in-sample correlation; multiple lag searches overfit. Compare trailing-window stability and reserve out-of-sample validation.": "最佳滞后取样本内绝对相关性最大值，多重滞后搜索可能过拟合。请比较后向窗口稳定性，并保留样本外验证。",
  "Empirical percentile: share of valid selected-range observations <= current. Inversion runs contain observed negative spreads; missing observations break a run.": "经验百分位为所选区间内不高于当前值的有效观测比例。倒挂区间由实际负利差观测组成；缺失观测会中断区间。",
  "Historical observation dates use latest stored FRED values, not verified ALFRED point-in-time availability. No interpolation or cross-date subtraction.": "历史观测使用当前存储的 FRED 值，并非已验证的 ALFRED 历史时点可用数据。不插值，也不跨日期相减。",
  "Transparent research rule, not NBER designation or recession probability. Latest history is revised-data hindsight; vintage is date precision only.": "这是透明的研究规则，并非 NBER 认定或衰退概率。最新模式的历史使用修订后数据回算；历史版本仅具有日期级精度。",
  "Current three-month unemployment average minus minimum of preceding 12 three-month averages (current month excluded). Latest = revised UNRATE, compare SAHMCURRENT; real-time release-specific differences are disclosed.": "当前三个月失业率均值，减去此前 12 个三个月均值中的最低值（不含当前月份）。最新模式使用修订后 UNRATE，并与 SAHMCURRENT 比较；实时发布口径差异会单独说明。",
