  "Core PCE · 3M annualized": "核心 PCE · 三个月年化",
  "Core PCE · 6M annualized": "核心 PCE · 六个月年化",
  "Monotone paragraph alignment (SequenceMatcher similarity ≥ 0.45, gap cost 0.3) then exact token diff; source paragraph text retained.": "先单调对齐段落（SequenceMatcher 相似度阈值 ≥ 0.45，缺口代价 0.3），再比较词元；保留原始段落文本。",
  "Transparent keyword matches; research labels, not official Federal Reserve categories.": "公开关键词匹配依据；标签属于研究分类，并非美联储官方分类。",
  "Exact variable + target year + statistic; new/missing years remain null.": "按变量、目标年份及统计类型精确对齐；新增或缺失年份保留为空。",
  "SEP reflects participants’ individual appropriate-policy assumptions; it is not a committee commitment or market probability.": "SEP 反映参与者各自适当政策假设下的预测，不代表委员会承诺或市场概率。",
  "Target bounds are separate policy limits. EFFR and DFF are observed rates. Latest stored series, not historical vintages.": "目标区间上下限是不同的政策边界；EFFR 与 DFF 为实际有效利率。这里使用当前存储的最新序列，并非历史版本。",
  "Change in official target upper bound × 100 bp versus preceding stored official meeting. First stored meeting has unknown change. Effective dates require implementation-note evidence.": "相较上一场已存官方会议，目标上限的百分点变化乘以 100 得到 bp。首场会议的变化未知；生效日期必须有实施说明作证。",
  "Pre-decision defaults to the previous full calendar day; no intraday Point-in-Time guarantee.": "决策前模式默认截止前一完整自然日，不保证精确的日内历史时点。",
  "Every document uses its own publication timestamp. Unknown publication is excluded.": "每份文档按独立的发布时间筛选；出版时间未知的文档不纳入快照。",
  "Post review defaults to the end of decision day; later minutes require a later as_of.": "决策后回顾默认截止决议日结束；稍后公布的纪要需选择更晚的截止日。",
  "No latest macro fallback. Raw official archive content retrieved now is not proof of unrecorded historical editorial revisions.": "不使用最新宏观值填补历史。当前获取的官方原文，无法证明此前未被记录的文字编辑历史。",
  "Historical Vintage Unavailable; no latest-data fallback": "历史版本不可用；不使用最新值回填",
  "Historical unit metadata unavailable": "历史单位元数据不可用",
  "Dynamic latest stored data; historical observation dates do not imply verified historical availability.": "动态读取当前存储的最新数据；历史观测日期不代表已经验证该数据当时可用。",
  "Earliest available ALFRED vintage, not certified official initial release. Cross-unit comparisons and incomplete fixed windows excluded; historical patterns do not guarantee future revisions.": "采用 ALFRED 最早可用版本，未经认证为官方初次发布值。排除跨单位比较和未结束固定窗口；历史模式不保证未来修订。",
  "Date-level ALFRED vintage; no intraday availability guarantee. Earliest archived value is not necessarily the official first release.": "ALFRED 仅日期级版本，不保证日内可用时刻。最早归档值未必是官方首次发布值。",
  "Ex-post USREC chronology only; never an input to calculations or historical decisions.": "仅为事后 USREC 时间表，不参与计算或历史决策输入。",
